<title>UK: Statoil sets $250 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Statoil sets $250 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   STATOIL</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     6.625     MATURITY    27.SEP.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.0025  PAY DATE    27.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.815    SPREAD	+5 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NO</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
